{"2015580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Painted Legend: Knights of Ink & Paper", "steam_appid": 2015580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5089420], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/821054168033dbf97826263743119af1.avif?t=1787234562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras_big/821054168033dbf97826263743119af1.webp?t=1787234562 width=1560 height=605 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painted Legend: Knights of Ink &amp; Paper</strong> is a hand-drawn action-adventure Metroidvania set inside a strange world of paper, ink and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous fantasy world, fight hordes of monsters, overcome traps, unlock new characters and search for secrets hidden between the lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.poster.avif?t=1787234562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.webm?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.mp4?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one quiet and peaceful night, a mysterious star awakens a knight drawn on a notebook page. Lured by its glow, he falls through the notebook into a world of adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the knight must face various trials and adventures to discover why the star summoned him to this world and how he can find his way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.poster.avif?t=1787234562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.webm?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.mp4?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the thrilling world of Painted Legend!</strong> In our metroidvania platformer, you'll dive into a unique world that looks like it came straight from the pages of a paper notebook. Prepare for epic battles, intricate puzzles, and dangerous traps scattered throughout castles and dungeons filled with fearsome monsters and enchanting fairy tale creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Art Style</strong>: Every detail of the game's world is hand-drawn in the style of notebook sketches, creating an unparalleled atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Characters</strong>: Play as a knight, mage, viking, and other fantasy heroes, each with their unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in a vast world full of secrets and hidden paths. Explore castles, dungeons, and many other locations filled with dangers and adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Traps</strong>: Overcome complex obstacles with hordes of enemies and puzzles to advance the storyline and meet your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles</strong>: Fight against numerous diverse monsters and bosses, each requiring a unique strategy to defeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our adventure and become the hero of a drawn world! An exciting journey full of discoveries and challenges awaits you. Be bold, future legend, the world needs you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/821054168033dbf97826263743119af1.avif?t=1787234562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras_big/821054168033dbf97826263743119af1.webp?t=1787234562 width=1560 height=605 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painted Legend: Knights of Ink &amp; Paper</strong> is a hand-drawn action-adventure Metroidvania set inside a strange world of paper, ink and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous fantasy world, fight hordes of monsters, overcome traps, unlock new characters and search for secrets hidden between the lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.poster.avif?t=1787234562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.webm?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/a70fa5030eda8ff49f974585e32188ca.mp4?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one quiet and peaceful night, a mysterious star awakens a knight drawn on a notebook page. Lured by its glow, he falls through the notebook into a world of adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the knight must face various trials and adventures to discover why the star summoned him to this world and how he can find his way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.poster.avif?t=1787234562\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.webm?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/435fafdc7e4c6d9f25bed6e19169aaa1.mp4?t=1787234562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the thrilling world of Painted Legend!</strong> In our metroidvania platformer, you'll dive into a unique world that looks like it came straight from the pages of a paper notebook. Prepare for epic battles, intricate puzzles, and dangerous traps scattered throughout castles and dungeons filled with fearsome monsters and enchanting fairy tale creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Art Style</strong>: Every detail of the game's world is hand-drawn in the style of notebook sketches, creating an unparalleled atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Characters</strong>: Play as a knight, mage, viking, and other fantasy heroes, each with their unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in a vast world full of secrets and hidden paths. Explore castles, dungeons, and many other locations filled with dangers and adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Traps</strong>: Overcome complex obstacles with hordes of enemies and puzzles to advance the storyline and meet your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles</strong>: Fight against numerous diverse monsters and bosses, each requiring a unique strategy to defeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our adventure and become the hero of a drawn world! An exciting journey full of discoveries and challenges awaits you. Be bold, future legend, the world needs you!</p>", "short_description": "A hand-drawn Metroidvania set inside a notebook. Explore a world of ink and paper, fight monsters, overcome deadly traps, unlock new heroes and uncover its hidden secrets!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/01e9f408b6063a5d1b447c6b5d597c6e11303171/header.jpg?t=1787234562", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/a584fe28204a9868b8d9bf312f74c4eb83dcf2b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787234562", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/a584fe28204a9868b8d9bf312f74c4eb83dcf2b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787234562", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 11 / 10 / 8 / 8.1 / 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</str